// Infinite loops

// [id:c2-A] [tag:c2] [tag:true_false]
::c2-A Convergence claim A::Statement A\: a loop whose variable moves away from the exit condition runs forever. {TRUE}

// [id:c2-B] [tag:c2] [tag:true_false]
::c2-B Convergence claim B::Statement B\: a loop whose variable moves away from the exit condition runs forever. {FALSE}

// [id:c2-C] [tag:c2] [tag:true_false]
::c2-C Convergence claim C::Statement C\: a loop whose variable moves away from the exit condition runs forever. {TRUE}

// [id:c2-D] [tag:c2] [tag:true_false]
::c2-D Convergence claim D::Statement D\: a loop whose variable moves away from the exit condition runs forever. {FALSE}

