// [id:c5-A] [tag:c5] [tag:multiple_choice]
::c5-A Gap in the loop condition (A)::[markdown]Complete the loop to draw circles\: `for (let x \= 20; ___; x +\= 30) \{ circle(x, 70); \}` (variant A) {
    ~[markdown]`x < 400`
    =[markdown]`x <\= 400`
    ~[markdown]`x \= 400`
    ~[markdown]`x < 370`
}

