$CATEGORY: top/Quizbot/demo/c7 What loops are good for
// What loops are good for

// [id:c7-A] [tag:c7] [tag:multiple_answer]
::c7-A Uses of repetition, set A::Which of these describe loops (set A)? Select all that apply. {
    ~%50%Repeating a shape across the canvas
    ~%-50%Reducing duplicated code
    ~%50%Driving a value with a counter
    ~%-50%Guaranteeing the sketch never crashes
}

// [id:c7-B] [tag:c7] [tag:multiple_answer]
::c7-B Uses of repetition, set B::Which of these describe loops (set B)? Select all that apply. {
    ~%-50%Repeating a shape across the canvas
    ~%50%Reducing duplicated code
    ~%-50%Driving a value with a counter
    ~%50%Guaranteeing the sketch never crashes
}

// [id:c7-C] [tag:c7] [tag:multiple_answer]
::c7-C Uses of repetition, set C::Which of these describe loops (set C)? Select all that apply. {
    ~%33.33333%Repeating a shape across the canvas
    ~%33.33333%Reducing duplicated code
    ~%33.33333%Driving a value with a counter
    ~%-100%Guaranteeing the sketch never crashes
}

// [id:c7-D] [tag:c7] [tag:multiple_answer]
::c7-D Uses of repetition, set D::Which of these describe loops (set D)? Select all that apply. {
    ~%-50%Repeating a shape across the canvas
